Z||000003||HummelHund||09-03-2001||09:27 PM||||Ok, I went out and looked at my stereo. I noticed that if I had it on then turned the car off for a few minutes, then turned it back on it would work, but if I left the car off for a longer period of time, I would have to pull the fuse to get it to work again. That does sound like what would happen with a theftlock type thing, so what do I do to disable it? Sorry if this is a stupid question, but I'm clueless when it comes to wiring and stereo type stuff.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Sean W.<BR>'84 SE 2M4 WS6, The "Buzz Bomb". (restoration project to become daily driver)<BR>84' SE 2M4 WS6 (Dad's Project)||||reg||1
